+	transport, stealth and heavy-lift helicopters 38-39; tilt-rotor 26 long x 37 wide; fighters, trainer and strike jets
+	28-40 long x 20-31 span. The heavies are held to a 34-35 span by the runway (24 wide, the base inner wall 18.8 studs
+	from its centre line; jet half span at most 17.5), so they are about as long as a narrow-body jet of that span:
